  "text": "Pet Chemotherapy In Traverse City, MI 49696 | Companion Animal Hospital\n\nEmergency: (231) 922-0911\n\nJoin Our Team\n\nEmergency: (231) 922-0911\n\nJoin Our Team\nBook Appointment\nHome\nAbout\nOur Story\nOur Team\nFAQs\nReviews\nPhoto Gallery\nCat-Friendly Practice\nServices\nResources\nOur App\nPayment Options\nEmergency Contact\nOnline Forms\nPhoto Release Form\nDog & Cat Welcome Form\nChinchilla Welcome Form\nHedgehog Welcome Form\nRabbit Welcome Form\nRodent Welcome Form\nShop Food & Meds\nOnline Store\nHill’s To Home\nContact\nWellness Plans\nBook Appointment\nHome\nAbout\nOur Story\nOur Team\nFAQs\nReviews\nPhoto Gallery\nCat-Friendly Practice\nServices\nResources\nOur App\nPayment Options\nEmergency Contact\nOnline Forms\nPhoto Release Form\nDog & Cat Welcome Form\nChinchilla Welcome Form\nHedgehog Welcome Form\nRabbit Welcome Form\nRodent Welcome Form\nShop Food & Meds\nOnline Store\nHill’s To Home\nContact\nWellness Plans\nBook Appointment\nNew Wellness Plans Available!\nLearn more\nabout our updated preventive care plans.\nChemotherapy\nNorthern Michigan’s top veterinary clinic, offering expert chemotherapy care for pets, in partnership with Michigan State University.\nBook Appointment\nBringing Cutting-Edge Cancer Care to Northern Michigan\nCompanion Animal Hospital\nproudly offers comprehensive chemotherapy services for cancer patients right here in Northern Michigan. In most cases, cancer patients are initially referred to the prestigious Michigan State University Oncology Center for evaluation. However, our exceptional team at Companion Animal Hospital, including Dr. Kavran and Dr. DeSimone, is uniquely equipped to bring world-class chemotherapy care closer to home.\nOur Commitment to Advanced Chemotherapy Care\nAt\nCompanion Animal Hospital\n, we understand that navigating cancer treatment for your beloved pet can be emotionally challenging. That’s why we’ve gone the extra mile to ensure that your pet receives the highest level of care right here in Northern Michigan.\nA Local Solution for Cancer Care:\nOur Partnership with Michigan State University\nWe are proud to partner with Michigan State University\nveterinarians\nto offer local chemotherapy treatments to patients who receive their initial treatment plans from MSU. This partnership means you can avoid the frequent trips downstate, reducing the stress on you and your pet.\nQuality of Life Matters Most\nAt\nCompanion Animal Hospital\n, we prioritize your pet’s well-being above all else. We understand that chemotherapy protocols must enhance your pet’s quality of life, not detract from it. Our approach is guided by compassion, and we will never recommend a protocol that makes your pet or you worse off than the disease itself.\nOur Mission:\nTo provide your furry companion the highest quality of life possible during their cancer journey. Trust us to be your partner in this crucial process.\nWe invite you to reach out to us today to discuss your pet’s unique needs and explore how our compassionate and expert team can make a meaningful difference in your pet’s battle against cancer. At\nCompanion Animal Hospital\n, we’re here to support you every step of the way.\nVeterinary Services\nAllergy Testing\nAnesthesiology\nBlood Pressure\nBloodwork\nChemotherapy\nComprehensive Physical Examinations\nDentistry\nDiagnostics\nEKG\nSoft Tissue Surgery\nEuthanasia\nGlaucoma Screening\nVaccinations\nCold Laser Therapy\nMicrochip Identification\nNutritional Consultation\nPain Management\nParasite Screening\nPocket Pet Care\nPost-Operative Care\nPreventive Health Care\nDigital Radiology\nSenior Pet Preventive Care\nSurgery\nUltrasonography\nUrinalysis\nBook an\nAppointment!\nConnect with us! Companion Animal Hospital proudly serves the communities of Williamsburg, Acme, Kingsley, Lake Ann, Interlochen, Elk Rapids, and surrounding areas.\nBook Appointment\nHave Questions?\nGet in touch. Complete our form, and a member of our team will be in touch with you shortly.\n\nAddress\n1885 Chartwell Drive\nTraverse City, MI 49696\n\nContact Information\nPhone:\n(231) 935-1511\nEmail:\nreception@cahtc.com\n\nHour of Operation\nMon & Thurs\n: 7:30 am – 5:30 pm*\nFri\n: 7:30 am – 5:00 pm*\nSat & Sun\n: Closed\n* Phones turn off a half-hour prior to close\nName\n*\nFirst\nLast\nEmail\n*\nPhone\nHow can we help you?\n*\nWebsite\nSubmit\nFollow\n© 2026 Companion Animal Hospital |\nPowered by PetDesk\n|\nPrivacy Policy\n|\nAccessibility Statement",
